Cell[TextData[{
 "1. Evaluate the dependence of the reaction velocity (as defined by the rate \
at which product occurs) on the substrate dependence (e.g. by setting in \
different substrate concentrations and graphical analysis of the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["c", "glucose"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a4cbbe9c-7f7c-40c9-a502-f24de37f9501"],
